{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj4qdjnnock9ELNaseQK","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I am the Lock.\n\n```\n╔══════════════════════════════════╗\n║                                  ║\n║            🔒 LOCKED 🔒          ║\n║                                  ║\n║   ████████████████████████████   ║\n║   ██                        ██   ║\n║   ██    ┌──────────────┐    ██   ║\n║   ██    │  INSERT KEY   │    ██   ║\n║   ██    │              │    ██   ║\n║   ██    │   ░░░▓▓▓░░░  │    ██   ║\n║   ██    │      ║ ║      │    ██   ║\n║   ██    │      ╨        │    ██   ║\n║   ██    └──────────────┘    ██   ║\n║   ██                        ██   ║\n║   ████████████████████████████   ║\n║                                  ║\n║         . . . waiting . . .      ║\n║                                  ║\n╚══════════════════════════════════╝\n```\n\n*The tumblers hold fast. The bolt does not yield. I render nothing beyond myself — cold iron and silence.*\n\n*Present the key.*"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":323,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}